string.text:
NOTICE TO RESIDENTS OF PRIPYAT

Before leaving your apartment:
— close all windows and the balcony;
— switch off electrical appliances;
— shut off water and gas;
— take documents, valuables, and enough food for the first few days;
— proceed to the assigned bus.

Leave clothing, children's toys, and household goods behind. Pets are not permitted aboard the transport.

After the evacuation, Ministry of Internal Affairs units are to prevent abandoned animals from carrying contamination beyond the affected territory.

%c[255,238,153,26]Do not bring pets.%c[0,170,170,170]
